Name: Material Color Utilities (Material Design 3 Expressive HCT & CAM16)
Short Name: material-color-utilities
URL: https://github.com/material-foundation/material-color-utilities
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 0.3.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/material-color-utilities
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/material-color-utilities

Description:
Algorithms and utilities that power the Material Design 3 (M3) color system, including HCT (Hue, Chroma, Tone) perceptual color space and multi-surface token generation.

Local Modifications:
- Integrated with GoogleMultiSurfaceCompiler (Web Wiz M3, Android Jetpack Compose, Flutter Dart, Zed GPUI Rust 2024, Google TV Leanback) in yolo-bun:google-stack.
